{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark in a breathtaking journey across the Valley, a shattered world that was inhabited a long ago by a mysterious, long gone civilization. You play as a ball of water that's the only hope of saving this land from the forces setting it ablaze. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044150/extras/AnimatedGif1.gif?t=1744157193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along this journey you will find puzzles that will test your ability to move quickly as you find new and creative ways to solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044150/extras/AnimatedGif2.gif?t=1744157193\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rolling Water is a platformer set in a beautiful natural world with a series of fun and challenging trials set in place by those before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044150/extras/AnimatedGif3.gif?t=1744157193\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3044150?t=1744157193","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3044150?t=1744157193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044150/be6a0220421a1e3d9563ba0cd946619ff480cd38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744157193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044150/be6a0220421a1e3d9563ba0cd946619ff480cd38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744157193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":